        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Ithihasa\n- People: Aneesh Lee Ashok, Binu S, Deepak Dev, Shine Tom Chacko\n- Topics: Malayalam cinema, fantasy comedy, body-swapping\n\nFacts:\n- In 2014, \"Ithihasa\" was released as a Malayalam fantasy comedy film.\n- Aneesh Lee Ashok wrote \"Ithihasa,\" and Binu S directed it.\n- \"Ithihasa\" deals with body-swapping.\n- In 2014, Shine Tom Chacko played his first lead role in Binu S Kalady's fantasy-comedy film \"Ithihasa.\"\n- Before \"Ithihasa,\" Shine Tom Chacko played supporting roles in \"Ee Adutha Kaalathu,\" \"Chapters,\" \"Annayum Rasoolum,\" and \"Masala Republic.\"\n- Deepak Devraj Komath, known as Deepak Dev, is an Indian music composer.\n- Deepak Dev is best known for his compositions in Malayalam cinema, including \"Chronic Bachelor,\" \"Udayananu Tharam,\" \"Naran,\" \"Puthiya Mukham,\" \"Urumi,\" \"Grandmaster,\" and \"Bhaskar the Rascal.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
